Input: {"question": "In which significant event was coat of arms of Noorbeek involved?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 146, "text": "As the sun dipped behind the rolling hills of Limburg, the villagers of Noorbeek gathered in the town square, their faces aglow with anticipation."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 147, "end": 228, "text": "It was a momentous day, one that would decide the fate of their humble community."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 229, "end": 391, "text": "At the center of the commotion stood the stately Mayor van der Meer, his eyes shining with a sense of purpose as he unfurled the revered coat of arms of Noorbeek."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 392, "end": 575, "text": "The emblem, adorned with the proud lion and the golden fleur-de-lis, seemed to radiate an aura of gravitas, as if the very history of the village was etched into its intricate design."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 576, "end": 680, "text": "The villagers, familiar with the symbol's significance, nodded in reverence as the mayor began to speak."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 681, "end": 821, "text": "\"My dear friends and neighbors,\" he declared, his voice carrying across the square, \"today we gather to consider a proposal of great import."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 822, "end": 971, "text": "The neighboring town of Valkenburg has requested our consent to merge our municipalities, promising greater economic prosperity and shared resources."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 972, "end": 1016, "text": "But we must not take this decision lightly.\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1017, "end": 1087, "text": "As the mayor paused, a murmur of discussion rippled through the crowd."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1088, "end": 1163, "text": "Some nodded enthusiastically, while others furrowed their brows in concern."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1164, "end": 1267, "text": "Amidst the debate, a young woman named Sophia stepped forward, her dark hair tied back in a neat braid."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1268, "end": 1396, "text": "She was the village's skilled herald, responsible for interpreting the ancient symbols and motifs that adorned the coat of arms."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1397, "end": 1527, "text": "\"Mayor van der Meer,\" Sophia said, her voice clear and confident, \"if I may be so bold, I believe our coat of arms holds a secret."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1528, "end": 1639, "text": "The lion, symbol of courage and strength, is positioned above the fleur-de-lis, representing purity and wisdom."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1640, "end": 1711, "text": "Is it not possible that this arrangement is more than mere coincidence?"}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1712, "end": 1768, "text": "That it speaks to the very heart of our decision today?\""}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1769, "end": 1853, "text": "The villagers exchanged curious glances, and the mayor's eyes narrowed thoughtfully."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1854, "end": 1885, "text": "\"Go on, Sophia,\" he encouraged."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1886, "end": 2009, "text": "\"The lion, in its position of dominance, suggests that we must prioritize our own strength and resilience in this decision."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2010, "end": 2105, "text": "Yet, the fleur-de-lis, nestled beneath, reminds us of the importance of wisdom and discernment."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2106, "end": 2285, "text": "Perhaps, in granting our consent, we must balance these two virtues, ensuring that our choice benefits not only ourselves, but also our neighbors and the future of our community.\""}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2286, "end": 2376, "text": "As Sophia finished speaking, the villagers fell silent, pondering the weight of her words."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 88, "text": "Title: The Heraldic Legacy of Noorbeek: Unveiling the Coat of Arms' Momentous Assignment"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 90, "end": 227, "text": "In the picturesque province of Limburg, Netherlands, lies the former municipality of Noorbeek, a region steeped in history and tradition."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 228, "end": 380, "text": "Amidst the rolling hills and verdant landscapes, a symbol of pride and identity has been passed down through generations – the coat of arms of Noorbeek."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 381, "end": 561, "text": "This emblematic representation of the municipality's heritage has been involved in a significant event, one that has left an indelible mark on the region's history: the assignment."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 562, "end": 670, "text": "The story begins in the 19th century, when the Netherlands was undergoing a period of administrative reform."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 671, "end": 849, "text": "As part of this process, the government sought to standardize the coats of arms of its municipalities, ensuring that each region had a unique and official symbol of its identity."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 850, "end": 986, "text": "It was during this time that the coat of arms of Noorbeek was formally assigned, marking a pivotal moment in the municipality's history."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 987, "end": 1173, "text": "On a crisp autumn morning in 1819, the High Council of Nobility, the governing body responsible for heraldic matters in the Netherlands, convened to discuss the coat of arms of Noorbeek."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1174, "end": 1335, "text": "The council, comprising esteemed members of the nobility and experts in heraldry, carefully deliberated on the design and symbolism of the proposed coat of arms."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1336, "end": 1580, "text": "After much debate and consideration, the council reached a unanimous decision: the coat of arms of Noorbeek would feature a shield with three silver chevrons on a blue background, accompanied by a golden crown and a pair of crossed silver keys."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1581, "end": 1711, "text": "This assignment was more than just a formal decision; it was a testament to the municipality's rich history and cultural heritage."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1712, "end": 1869, "text": "The three silver chevrons, for instance, represented the three rivers that flowed through Noorbeek, symbolizing the region's connection to the natural world."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1870, "end": 2031, "text": "The golden crown signified the municipality's sovereignty and autonomy, while the crossed silver keys represented the keys to the region's prosperity and growth."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2032, "end": 2160, "text": "The assignment of the coat of arms was a momentous occasion, marking a new era of identity and unity for the people of Noorbeek."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2161, "end": 2304, "text": "The coat of arms became an integral part of the municipality's daily life, adorning official documents, flags, and even the local architecture."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2305, "end": 2425, "text": "It was a constant reminder of the region's history, culture, and values, serving as a beacon of pride for the community."}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["the assignment"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "the assignment", "origin": "initial"}]}
